/-!
# Bounds for the explicit remainders `XR4X`, `XWX`

`B24XMData.Xtrunc2X_decomp` writes

  `Xtrunc2X - B2E2 - B3E3 - B4E4 - B5E5 = E4 XR4X + E6 XWX`

with `XR4X`, `XWX` explicit sums of monomials in the atoms.  Here they are bounded in the
`BoundQ` calculus: `|XR4X| <= C (scale tau)^N (1+t)^M` and
`|XWX| <= C |q(tau)|^-1 (scale tau)^N (1+t)^M`.

The exponent bookkeeping is `n = (#Delta) - (#j)`; the single excepted cluster is the `theta24`
pair whose bounded sum is `BoundQ_theta24_group`.
-/

